9.nenu-evarini.pdf

# Evaluation outputs: they contain model answers grounded in the book text,
# which must never be committed. eval/gold_qa.jsonl (our own questions) IS tracked.
# Ignored by extension rather than filename so that adding a new harness cannot
# silently start committing its results.
eval/*.json
eval/*.jsonl
!eval/gold_qa.jsonl

# Partially-downloaded files (browser .crdownload / temp) — datasets and models
# are large and must never be committed.
*.crdownload
*.part
*.tmp